WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Every cut changes the thought
These coffee-making views carry different information. Select for the job of each shot before polishing the timeline.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose useful information
A beautiful shot can still repeat what we know. Keep the views that establish, advance or resolve the action.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Build the order
Check cause and effect. An empty cup, a pour and a filled cup form a readable change when their order is intentional.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Cut through an action
Match the phase of a gesture across views. Test the cut a few frames earlier and later while playing at normal speed.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Compare two rhythms
Hold to let us observe. Trim to remove hesitation. Faster is only better when the action and intention remain clear.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Choose your edit
Keep the same clips. Make two versions. Explain one timing decision that changed how the sequence feels.
